"bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec "
"\"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") is applied to a bosonic circuit.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Design principles of operator representations](operators#operators-"
"explanation) for how a "
"[`BosonOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators-"
"boson-operator#qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator "
"\"qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator\") stores and orders its terms, "
"including the contraction rule behind the normal-ordering example above.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Rotate bosonic modes](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-explanation) for the"
" gate that moves bosons between modes, which is where the reachable-"
"occupation warning matters most.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Consult the API reference of "
"[`qiskit_bosons.mappers`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"bosons/mappers#module-qiskit_bosons.mappers \"qiskit_bosons.mappers\") and "
"[`qiskit_bosons.mappers.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"bosons/mappers-library#module-qiskit_bosons.mappers.library "
"\"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library\").\n"
msgstr ""

